# The released-true smoke self-CI job runs `git init` inside this directory
# at runtime and seeds a `feat:` commit so semantic-release can infer
# "would release v1.0.0". The runtime-created `.git/` and any generated
# artifacts (node_modules/, .releaserc, semantic-release logs) must not
# leak into the surrounding hashira-ops git index — this .gitignore exists
# to make the runtime state invisible to the outer repo.
.git/
node_modules/
.releaserc
*.log
